  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can you help me make a playlist for a party where the ages go from four to eighty?",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Fun challenge. Do you want it mostly in the background or will people dance?",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Dancing, hopefully, after cake.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.53,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then build it in waves. Start with gentle classics everyone knows, add some cheerful kids' songs around cake time, and save big singalong hits for later.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Give me an example of a singalong that works for everyone.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.45,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Old disco tends to bridge the generations. Grandparents know it, parents love it, and kids just like the beat.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.57,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I include",
